# Class: obo:COB_0000022 (organism)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:COB_0000022 "A material entity that is a maximal functionally integrated unit that develops from a program encoded in a genome"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:COB_0000022 "'Maximal functionally integrated unit' is intended to express unity, which Barry considers synonymous with BFO 'object'."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:COB_0000022 "Includes virus - we will later have a class for cellular organisms."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:COB_0000022 "organism"@en)

